text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M03_Text_08187C42 {
    "This is our special exhibit hall."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M03_Text_08187C64 {
    "As you can plainly see, there is not a\nsingle painting on exhibit.\pHere, I don’t wish to exhibit works of\nso-called classical art.\pSuch classical works you can see on\nour ground floor.\pI wish to exhibit work that is far\ndifferent from the classics.\pArt, after all, is not restricted to old,\nfamous works!\pThis exhibit hall, I wish to fill it with...\pModern and vibrant artworks of\nPOKéMON seemingly ready to spring\lforth into glorious life!"
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M03_Text_08187E1D {
    "I beg your pardon. I didn’t intend\nto monopolize the conversation.\pNow, as you are young, and yet\nobviously well traveled...\pYou must encounter lively POKéMON\nand works of art depicting them.\pIf you were to come across such a\npainting, may we ask you to obtain\lthe artist’s permission to exhibit\lit here?"
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M03_Text_08187F4E {
    "I wish to fill this exhibit hall with\nmodern and vibrant paintings of\lPOKéMON."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M03_Text_08187F9D {
    "Thanks to you, we’ve added a new\npainting to our collection!\pI’ve heard it depicts your POKéMON.\nTruly magnificent!\pThank you so very, very much!"
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M03_Text_0818802F {
    "Ah! It’s you!\n{PLAYER}!"
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M03_Text_08188041 {
    "Isn’t this marvelous?\nThis collection of paintings!\pEach one of them flawless!\nNone better than another!\pThese paintings have attracted\nmore guests to our ART MUSEUM.\pSincerely, I thank you, {PLAYER}.\nThis is my dream come true!"
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M03_Text_08188120 {
    "This is merely a token of my gratitude."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M03_Text_08188166 {
    "I will keep this for you until we\nmeet again."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M03_Text_08188194 {
    "Ah, so good to see you, {PLAYER}!\pIt’s an honor to have you visit us\non your busy journeys.\pPlease, relax and do enjoy your\nvisit with us."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M03_Text_08188219 {
    "It’s a picture frame with pink-colored\nadornments."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M03_Text_0818824C {
    "It’s a picture frame with yellow-colored\nadornments."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M03_Text_08188281 {
    "It’s a picture frame with blue-colored\nadornments."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M03_Text_081882B4 {
    "It’s a picture frame with red-colored\nadornments."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M03_Text_081882E6 {
    "It’s a picture frame with green-colored\nadornments."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M03_Text_0818831A {
    "It’s a painting of POKéMON."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M03_Text_08188336 {
    "I’ve been away awhile, so the new\npaintings up here surprised me.\pI wish someone would paint my POKéMON\nthis pretty."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M03_Text_081883AB {
    "Well... So this is where they show the\ntopical POKéMON paintings.\pI see, these new paintings are indeed\nrather amusing."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M03_Text_08188423 {
    "Wow, is that right?\nThese paintings are of your POKéMON.\pIsn’t that just the ultimate joy for\na TRAINER?"
}
